You know, I'm not sure. If you asked me today, I'd probably say {le silna 
xukmi}.

As for the other, I'm not talking about the lack of a se klama, Deixis is 
the thing that makes "Come to my house" imply {mi ja'a zvati le mi zdani} 
and "Go to my house" imply {mi na zvati le mi zdani}.

